('usb-plug-night-light', 'Mini USB Night Light Warm White Plug-in', 'accessories', 2500, 2500, 1800, 200, 0.02, '/assets/products/usb-plug-night-light.jpg', 'Ultra-compact USB-powered night light with warm white LED (3000K). Plugs directly into any USB port (power bank, laptop, wall charger). Soft, gentle glow perfect for hotel rooms, hallways, children''s rooms, and bedside. Auto on/off light sensor or continuous on mode. Energy-efficient with 10,000-hour lifespan. Impulse buy travel essential.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1800, '/assets/products/usb-plug-night-light.jpg', 1980, 4.3, 0, 'Generic', 1, 0),

